WEBVTT

00:00:27.750 --> 00:00:30.559
or toward a nightmare of surveillance?

00:00:30.583 --> 00:00:31.851
I don't know.

00:00:31.875 --> 00:00:33.375
My interest is in the present.

00:00:34.208 --> 00:00:36.309
And I'd like to show you

00:00:36.333 --> 00:00:40.309
how the past can help us
understand the present.

00:00:40.333 --> 00:00:42.976
There's nothing that summarizes

00:00:43.000 --> 00:00:45.768
both the promise
and the danger of efficiency

00:00:45.792 --> 00:00:47.768
like the humble potato.

00:00:47.792 --> 00:00:50.309
The potato originated in the Andes

00:00:50.333 --> 00:00:55.476
and it spread to Europe
from the ancient Inca.

00:00:55.500 --> 00:01:00.250
The potato is a masterpiece
of balanced nutrition.